; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 36. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'game_over_sequence'
game_over_sequence.dialogstring_00D848! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Shadow: When I came to, I[N]was at a place that was[N]familiar to me…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sE5_epilogue'
sE5_epilogue.dialogstring_0BD558! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][SFX:0][DLY:6]Kara: I wonder what will[N]become of the comet…?[PAU:78][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][SFX:0][DLY:6]And what in the world is[N]that huge, shining blue[N]star out there?[PAU:B4][CLD]`
sE5_epilogue.dialogstring_0BD5A0! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][SFX:0][DLY:6]Olman: The comet has lost[N]its power.[PAU:78][CLR]Soon it will drift out[N]of sight.[PAU:B4][CLR][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][SFX:0][DLY:6]Will. [PAU:28]Don't you know that[N]blue star floating in the[N]darkness somehow?[PAU:B4][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][SFX:0][DLY:6]Will: That's our planet…?[PAU:78][CLR][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:6][SFX:0]Olman: That's right.[N]That's our planet, the[N]Earth.[PAU:78][CLR]Doesn't it seem like an[N]oasis in the desert?[PAU:B4][CLR][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:6][SFX:0]Kara: So the thing that[N]we called the Earth was[N]something so pretty?[PAU:B4][CLR]But shining alone in the[N]darkness, it seems somehow[N]lonely…[PAU:B4][CLD]`
sE5_epilogue.dialogstring_0BD70E! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][SFX:0][DLY:6]Mysterious voice: That's[N]right. The Earth is[N]lonesome.[PAU:B4][CLD]`
sE5_epilogue.dialogstring_0BD740! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][SFX:0][DLY:6]Will: Mom…!?[PAU:B4][CLR][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][DLY:6][SFX:0]Shira: The Earth… A[N]mother that has hundreds[N]of millions of children.[PAU:B4][CLR]Sometimes Will remembered[N]us. Kara, did you[N]sometimes think of your[N]parents?[PAU:B4][CLR]The Earth is the same.[N]It's lonely when it is[N]forgotten by its children.[PAU:B4][CLR][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:6][SFX:0]Olman: How is it? Both of[N]you?[PAU:B4][CLR]What do you feel, gazing[N]from the outside at the[N]planet you yourselves[N]lived on?[PAU:B4][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][SFX:0][DLY:6]Kara: It's as if we've[N]become God…[PAU:B4][CLR][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:6][SFX:0]Will: I want to show this[N]to Lance and everyone…[PAU:78][CLR][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][SFX:0][DLY:6]No, I want to show this[N]scenery to people[N]throughout the world…[PAU:B4][CLR][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:6][SFX:0]Olman: Someday people[N]will build ships that can[N]reach space.[PAU:B4][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][SFX:0][DLY:6]Then they'll see this[N]blue Earth with their[N]own eyes.[PAU:B4][CLR][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][SFX:0][DLY:6]When that happens, I want[N]them to see the Earth[N]making a lovely face like[N]it is for the two of you.[PAU:B4][CLR]Olman: Look. Please look[N]closely at the map of the[N]world you're holding.[PAU:B4][CLR][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:6][SFX:0]Will: Ah. The shapes on[N]the map are starting to[N]change…![PAU:B4][CLD]`

?INCLUDE 's90_changed_world'
s90_changed_world.dialogstring_0BDED4! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][SFX:0][DLY:6]Will: The land transformed[N]into a strange shape[N]somehow.[PAU:B4][CLR][BOR:4][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:6][SFX:0]Olman: That's the new[N]world.[PAU:B4][CLR][BOR:7][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:6][SFX:0]Kara: New world?[PAU:B4][CLR][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:6][SFX:0]Olman: For ages, the[N]comet's power has shaped[N]life--even the Earth[N]itself--[PAU:B4][CLR]toward an ending of its[N]choosing.[PAU:B4][CLR]That influence is gone[N]now.[PAU:B4][CLR]From here, the Earth and[N]its people will follow a[N]path of their own.[PAU:B4][CLD]`

?INCLUDE 'sE5_epilogue'
sE5_epilogue.dialogstring_0BD9FA! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][SFX:0][DLY:6]Will: Dad… Mom… how can[N]you see the future?[PAU:B4][CLR][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:6][SFX:0]Olman: When I lost my[N]corporeal body, it was as[N]if I became able to see[N]everything.[PAU:B4][CLR]Events of the past, events[N]of the future, and even[N]the path that humanity is[N]following.[PAU:B4][CLR]Perhaps people would call[N]a being with a body like[N]this a god.[PAU:B4][CLR][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][DLY:6][SFX:0]Shira: Anyhow, with[N]everything being done you[N]two can turn back into[N]normal children as well.[PAU:B4][CLR]It's okay not to think[N]about scary things[N]anymore.[PAU:B4][CLR][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:6][SFX:0]Kara: Will… when the Earth[N]changes back, are we going[N]to be separated?[PAU:B4][CLR][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:6][SFX:0]Olman: That's right… As[N]the Earth is changing too,[N]even people and history[N]will begin to walk new[N]paths.[PAU:B4][CLR]Supposing even that you[N]two encounter each other[N]at a street corner[N]somewhere, you probably[N]won't recognize each[N]other…[PAU:B4][CLR]But I guess that when the[N]Earth needs the Warrior of[N]Light and Darkness,[N]perhaps you two will[N]happen to meet again.[PAU:B4][CLR]Well, please head to Earth[N]before the comet's power[N]vanishes completely.[PAU:B4][CLR][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][DLY:6][SFX:0]Shira: It would be great[N]if a wonderful future came[N]to visit the two of you,[N]wouldn't it…?[PAU:B4][CLD]`
sE5_epilogue.dialogstring_0BDC95! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][SFX:0][DLY:6]Kara: Will…[PAU:28] Come this way…[PAU:50][N]And show me your face[N]closely…[PAU:B4][CLR]I want it to be firmly[N]burned into my mind.[PAU:B4][CLR]Your eyes,[PAU:1E] your nose,[PAU:1E] your[N]mouth,[PAU:28] your hair,[PAU:1E] your[N]voice,[PAU:28] and even your[N]warmth…[PAU:B4][CLD]`
sE5_epilogue.dialogstring_0BDD34! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][SFX:0][DLY:6]Will: You don't have to[N]worry.[PAU:3C] Because I will[N]definitely find you.[PAU:B4][CLR]No matter how many years[N]it takes,[PAU:3C] even if a[N]hundred years,[PAU:1E] a thousand[N]years,[PAU:1E] I will come to meet[N]you again.[PAU:B4][CLR]So be at ease…[PAU:5A][N]And shut your eyes…[PAU:78][CLD]`
sE5_epilogue.dialogstring_0BDDE5! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][SFX:0][DLY:6]Kara: Will…[PAU:78][CLD]`
sE5_epilogue.dialogstring_0BDE02! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][SFX:0][DLY:6]Will: Well, let's go.[N]To the Earth…[PAU:B4][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][SFX:0][DLY:6]Kara: Yeah…[PAU:B4][CLD]`

?INCLUDE 's89_new_babel'
s89_new_babel.dialogstring_0BE075! `[DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][SFX:0][DLY:8]The Earth wears a new[N]face, but beneath the[N]red sky it is as beautiful[N]as ever.[PAU:B4][CLR]Buildings rise where[N]forests once stood.[N]Traffic replaces rivers.[N]The cities teem with[N]smiles.[PAU:B4][CLR]Only the Earth seems[N]lonely.[PAU:B4][CLR]Tomorrow morning, Will[N]and Kara will begin their[N]new lives.[PAU:B4][CLR]The Tower of Babel of[N]1993 rises above the city,[N]as if it knows what lies[N]ahead for the Earth.[PAU:F0][CLD]`

?INCLUDE 'sF0_class_dismissed'
sF0_class_dismissed.dialogstring_09DD10! `[DLG:0,17][SIZ:F,3][DLY:5]   Today's lesson ends here.[N][PAU:B4][CLR]   Traffic accidents have been[N]   on the increase recently.[N][PAU:F0][CLR]    Everyone, be careful of[N]   cars when returning home.[N][PAU:68][CLD]`
